msgstr ""
"*Outer Fence* (Chinees: 外屏, Pinyin: Wài Píng) bestaat uit 7 sterren ten "
"zuiden van de *Legs*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Pigsty
