msgstr ""
"*Official in Charge of Pasturing* (Chinees: 右更, Pinyin: Yòu Gēng) bestaat "
"uit 5 sterren ten westen van de *Bond*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Official in Charge
