"*Ricks of Grain* (Chinese: 天庾, Pinyin: Tiān Yǔ) consists of 3 stars "
"southeast of the *Square Celestial Granary*."
msgstr ""
"*Ricks of Grain* (Chinees: 天庾, Pinyin: Tiān Yǔ) bestaat uit 3 sterren ten "
"zuidoosten van de *Square Celestial Granary*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Stomach
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Stomach
