"*Lunar Star* (Chinese: 月, Pinyin: Yuè) is 1 star east of the *Hairy Head*."
msgstr ""
"*Lunar Star* (Chinees: 月, Pinyin: Yuè) ligt 1 ster ten oosten van de *Hairy "
