#. Sardinian sky culture name
msgid "Sardinian"
msgstr "Sardinian"

#. Sardinian sky culture introduction section in markdown format
msgid ""
"Like all peoples of the world, even the ancient Sardinians, turned their "
"eyes to the sky that marked the time and the seasons. The peasant's world "
"has given its name to the stars and the constellations of the Sardinian "
"culture."
msgstr ""
"Gelijk alle volkeren op de wereld, richten ook de oudere Sardiniërs, hun "
"ogen naar de hemel die de tijd en de seizoenen bepaalde. De wereld van de "
"boer heeft aan de sterren en de sterrenstelsels hun gegeven in de "
"Sardinische cultuur."

#. Sardinian sky culture references section in markdown format
msgid ""
" - [#1]: [Stars and constellations in sardinian language](https://web.archive.org/web/20201029082540/http://www.sarabu.it/193_521_news_2863.php)\n"
" - [#2]: [Stellarium Script: Sardinian Constellations Tour](http://www.stellarium.org/wiki/index.php/Scripts)\n"
" - [#3]: [Stellarium Wiki](http://www.stellarium.org/wiki/index.php/Sky_cultures#Sardinian)"
msgstr ""
" - [#1]: [Sterren en sterrenbeelden in het sardisch](https://web.archive.org/web/20201029082540/http://www.sarabu.it/193_521_news_2863.php)\n"
" - [#2]: [Stellarium Script: Sardinische sterrenbeelden tour](http://www.stellarium.org/wiki/index.php/Scripts)\n"
" - [#3]: [Stellarium Wiki](http://www.stellarium.org/wiki/index.php/Sky_cultures#Sardinian)"

